echo-service
variable heard?
: heard ( data len -- ) ." heard from " udp-peer-ip .ip ." :" udp-peer-port (.) type ." : " type cr  true heard? ! ;
' heard 5000 udp-bind
: to-peer ( addr u -- flag ) 10000 deadline >r  begin 2dup 5000 [ ip 10.0.2.2 ] literal 7 udp-send 0= while  r@ expired? if 2drop r> drop false exit then 100 ms  repeat 2drop r> drop true ;
: wait-heard ( -- ) 5000 deadline begin heard? @ over expired? or 0= while 50 ms repeat drop ;
s" hello, peer" to-peer .  wait-heard
5000 udp-unbind
s" again" to-peer .  500 ms
5000 ms
